' HATA YAKALAMA
'==============================================================================

TestError:

    HataNo = Err.Number

    HataAciklama = Err.Description

    On Error Resume Next

    If TestChargeID > 0 Then

        DeleteTestCharge TestChargeID

    End If

    On Error GoTo 0

